{"seq":1,"slug":"three-great-enterprises","title":"三大事业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kyocera-the-foundation","title":"京瓷：事业的基石","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises/kyocera-the-foundation","wordCount":1684,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"kddi-and-jal-turnaround","title":"第二电电与日航重建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises/kddi-and-jal-turnaround","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"三大事业\">三大事业</h1><p>本章呈现稻盛和夫缔造的三大事业。京瓷，是稻盛和夫事业的基石；第二电电（KDDI）与日本航空的重建，则是其经营才华的又两座丰碑。这三大事业，皆取得了非凡的成功，共同铸就了稻盛和夫&quot;经营之圣&quot;的崇高地位。两篇文档，分别呈现京瓷这一事业基石，以及第二电电与日航重建的丰碑。</p>\n"}